title: "CRC DTP Pipeline: analysis code for a colorectal cancer drug-tolerant persister signature"
abstract: "R pipeline evaluating a colorectal cancer drug-tolerant persister (DTP) gene signature against clinical outcome, comprising ssGSEA scoring, Cox and Kaplan-Meier survival analysis across colorectal and pan-cancer TCGA cohorts, CMS and PDS molecular subtyping, and paired-tissue differential expression."
type: software
